  BookText: "Fire isn\u2019t anger. It\u2019s pressure and control. \n\nDraw a slow
    breath, hold the heat in your chest until it steadies, then push it into your
    hand and give it shape. Don\u2019t try to throw it, direct it. \n\nA clean thought
    makes a clean flame.\n- Morghatul, Archmage of the Magi Circle."
